# Wisdoverse Forge Code Owners
# These owners will be requested for review when someone opens a pull request.
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# NOTE: References @Wisdoverse/* teams; create these in GitHub org settings
#   (Wisdoverse → Teams → New team) or replace with individual @username for the
#   review requests to actually fire. Without matching teams, GitHub silently
#   skips auto-review-assignment for matched paths.
# Default owners for everything in the repo
*                           @Wisdoverse/maintainers

# Frontend
/src/                       @Wisdoverse/frontend
/src/app/                   @Wisdoverse/frontend
/shared/                    @Wisdoverse/frontend @Wisdoverse/backend

# Default Rust backend
/rust/                      @Wisdoverse/backend
/rust/bins/                 @Wisdoverse/backend
/rust/crates/               @Wisdoverse/backend
/shared/generated/platform/ @Wisdoverse/backend

# Infrastructure
/.github/                   @Wisdoverse/devops
/.github/workflows/         @Wisdoverse/devops
/docker/                    @Wisdoverse/devops
/Makefile                   @Wisdoverse/devops
/.env.example               @Wisdoverse/devops

# Documentation
/docs/                      @Wisdoverse/docs
/*.md                       @Wisdoverse/docs
/CHANGELOG.md               @Wisdoverse/maintainers

# Security-sensitive files
/rust/crates/auth/          @Wisdoverse/security
/rust/crates/api/src/middleware.rs @Wisdoverse/security
/rust/crates/api/src/mcp.rs @Wisdoverse/security

# Configuration files
/package.json               @Wisdoverse/maintainers
/tsconfig.json              @Wisdoverse/maintainers
/tsconfig.eslint.json       @Wisdoverse/maintainers
/eslint.config.js           @Wisdoverse/maintainers
/.prettierrc.*              @Wisdoverse/maintainers

# Tests
/tests/                     @Wisdoverse/qa
*.test.ts                   @Wisdoverse/qa
*.spec.ts                   @Wisdoverse/qa
